{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51201","headline":"五言白话诗 八 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道须鬼兵，逢头即须搦。\n欲似园中果，未熟亦须摘。\n老少总皆去，共同衆死厄。\n长命得八十，恰同寄住客。\n蹔在主人家，不久自分擘。\n喻若行路人，前後踏光陌。\n（「光」，戴密微校作「巷」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}